---
import Icon from '@/components/ui/Icon.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config/site';
---

<section class="shell mt-24 sm:mt-28" aria-labelledby="working-together-title">
  <div class="reveal grid items-center gap-10 rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-7 sm:p-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wider uppercase text-muted">Working together</p>
      <h2 id="working-together-title" class="mt-3 text-section">
        Most engagements start with an ambitious scope that needs <span class="serif">structure.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body">
        Whether you are hiring a senior delivery lead or untangling a multi-team roadmap, send over the context. I’ll give you a direct, practical perspective on scope, risks, and how I would organize execution.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
      <div class="grid divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line sm:grid-cols-2 sm:divide-x sm:divide-y-0">
        <a href="https://wa.me/923331335258" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="p-4 transition hover:bg-line/30">
          <p class="text-xs text-muted">WhatsApp / Direct</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-body">+92 333 1335258</p>
        </a>
        <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.author.email}`} class="p-4 transition hover:bg-line/30">
          <p class="text-xs text-muted">Write to me</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-body">{siteConfig.author.email}</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.author.email}`}>
          Start a conversation
          <Icon name="arrow-right" class="icon-nudge size-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
